  "body": "## Summary\n\n- Adds a **Media Missing & Queue** widget that shows which movies/episodes are missing from your library and what is currently downloading, pulling data from Radarr and Sonarr\n- Poster-art backdrop-blur behind each card for ambient colour (matches the `media-releases` widget pattern); animated striped progress bars + pulse dot for active downloads; hover lift + primary-colour border\n- Width-based column scaling \u2014 fills wide widgets with multiple columns instead of stretching one column; collapses to count-only tabs at narrow widths\n- Default size 4\u00d73 so the widget ships at a useful scale; `addItemToBoard` mutation now reads `widgetDefaultSizes` instead of always using 1\u00d71\n- Documentation page with screenshots (missing grid, download queue, compact view)\n\n## Screenshots\n\n| Missing tab (4\u00d73) | Queue tab | Compact (2\u00d71) |\n|---|---|---|\n| ![missing](https://github.com/xanyl/homarr/raw/feat/missing-queued-widget/apps/docs/docs/widgets/media-missing/img/missing.png) | ![queued](https://github.com/xanyl/homarr/raw/feat/missing-queued-widget/apps/docs/docs/widgets/media-missing/img/queued.png) | ![compact](https://github.com/xanyl/homarr/raw/feat/missing-queued-widget/apps/docs/docs/widgets/media-missing/img/compact.png) |\n\n## Changes\n\n- `packages/widgets/src/media-missing/component.tsx` \u2014 full visual redesign with backdrop cards, density system, width-based columns\n- `packages/widgets/src/media-missing/component.module.css` \u2014 card, backdrop, poster, pulse-dot styles\n- `packages/definitions/src/widget.ts` \u2014 `mediaMissing` default size 4\u00d73; `widgetDefaultSizes` map\n- `packages/definitions/src/docs/widget-doc-slugs.ts` \u2014 adds `mediaMissing: \"media-missing\"` (fixes typecheck)\n- `packages/api/src/router/board.ts` \u2014 `addItemToBoard` reads `widgetDefaultSizes` instead of hardcoding 1\u00d71\n- `apps/docs/docs/widgets/media-missing/` \u2014 documentation page + screenshots\n- `packages/integrations/.../media-organizer-types.ts` \u2014 `year?: number` added to `QueuedMediaItem` (Radarr was already setting it)\n- `apps/nextjs/src/components/access/inherit-access-table.tsx` \u2014 fix duplicate React key `admin-group-id`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [ ] Add widget from the widget picker \u2192 spawns at 4\u00d73\n- [ ] Resize to 1\u00d72 (narrow): tabs collapse to icon + count only, single-column grid\n- [ ] Resize to 2\u00d71 (wide+short): two columns, shorter cards\n- [ ] Resize to 4\u00d73 (large): three or four columns with backdrop art visible\n- [ ] Queue tab: progress bars animate; pulse dot visible for in-progress downloads\n- [ ] No console errors on BoardSettingsPage (duplicate key fix)\n- [ ] `pnpm typecheck` passes\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a new \u201cMedia Missing & Queue\u201d widget that shows missing and queued items from supported media integrations.\n  * Added widget controls to show/hide missing or queued items and adjust page size.\n  * The widget now adapts to different sizes and displays richer item details, progress, and status.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved access list rendering by removing duplicate inherited entries.\n  * Newly added widgets now use their intended default size on boards.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
